msgid "Gáspár Nagy and Seb Rose — [The BDD Books](https://bddbooks.com/): _Discovery_ and _Formulation_, with Japanese editions on Leanpub"
msgstr "Gáspár Nagy と Seb Rose — [The BDD Books](https://bddbooks.com/)：*Discovery* と *Formulation*。Leanpub に日本語版がある"

